# TypeScript

See `AGENTS.md`.

## MUST

- Honor `strict: true`
- Prefer named exports and interfaces for object shapes
- Alphabetize imports/members/keys when order does not matter
- Validate untrusted input at the handler boundary

## MUST NOT

- Introduce unjustified `any`
- Disable TypeScript strict checks
